{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.103:0.2", "PA_thag_1.103:0.3"], "en": "Ekādasamavagga (The Eleventh Chapter)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.103:0.4"], "en": "The Verses of the Elder Bandhura:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.103:1.1"], "en": "“I have no need for this;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.103:1.2"], "en": "I am happy, satiated by the flavor of the Dhamma.”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.103:1.3"], "en": "“Having drunk the most excellent of tastes,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.103:1.4"], "en": "I shall not cultivate intimacy with poison.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.103:1.5"], "en": "… Thus spoke the Elder Bandhura.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
